this gBASIC draws blocks: true
before any run: (no blocks)
while sec-2 runs: res-sec-2@9 text
after running all four: res-sec-2@9 text, res-sec-2-rows@9 table, res-sec-4@15 text
  the text is untouched: true, unsaved: false
the collapse control
  pressed once: block-collapsed -> res-sec-2@9 text collapsed, res-sec-2-rows@9 table, res-sec-4@15 text
  a click on the body changes nothing: res-sec-2@9 text collapsed, res-sec-2-rows@9 table, res-sec-4@15 text
  pressed again: block-expanded -> res-sec-2@9 text, res-sec-2-rows@9 table, res-sec-4@15 text
a line added at the top: every block is one line lower
  res-sec-2@10 text, res-sec-2-rows@10 table, res-sec-4@16 text
Settings > Show results under sections
  inline-off: (no blocks), checked=false
  inline-on: res-sec-2@10 text, res-sec-2-rows@10 table, res-sec-4@16 text, checked=true
a theme change rebuilds the editor, and the blocks are sent to the new one
  theme-set: res-sec-2@10 text, res-sec-2-rows@10 table, res-sec-4@16 text
